    },
    {
      "id": "897796b0-3cbf-5b41-82bb-263d38a72fa3",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 2,
      "x": 340,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": null,
      "content": "훈련 기록이 며칠째 제자리걸음이다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Training results have been stuck for days.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "417b7aea-df0d-5115-88b7-5179a53135f0",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 3,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "감독님… 요즘 아무리 훈련해도 늘지가 않아요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Coach... no matter how much I train, I'm not getting better.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "894dd4ed-9e31-56d0-b93f-b64c99eb7c07",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "벽에 막힌 느낌이에요. 뭘 붙잡고 넘어서야 할지 모르겠어요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "It feels like I hit a wall. I don't know what to hold on to, to get past it.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7f67b16e-3ba9-51ce-ab4b-2ad3eeda897a",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "23f70dcf-de2b-50ea-a210-97bcdd22d3a0",
      "content": "연습만으로는 이제 한계야. 실전에서 넘어 보자. 목표를 하나 정하지.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Practice alone won't do it now. Let's break through in real matches. Pick a goal.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f64847d4-2a47-52ca-ae67-d3dff81db480",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "39e38b72-5d60-5b2f-a38a-31bb9d5a643f",
          "text": "(목표 고르기 — 게임이 목표 셋으로 바꾼다)",
          "sharedValues": {
            "8773fb44-a705-528a-9020-ee053093e9c7": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:39e38b72-5d60-5b2f-a38a-31bb9d5a643f": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "(Goal pick — the game replaces it with three goals)",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8bc06cf8-b0d0-537c-ad59-52c6b60aa276",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1840,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "알겠습니다. 꼭 해내 볼게요!",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Got it. I'll make it happen!",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "44eaf647-9d87-5270-88cd-ef04ab1cdbf4",
      "type": "End",
